# game/ch03.rpy:16
translate english ch3_edceb2f2:

    # n "周六的晚上，作业早就写完，阿狐窝在卧室里用平板和同学聊天。"
    n "Saturday evening. Homework done long ago, Ahu was curled up in his bedroom, chatting with classmates on his tablet."

# game/ch03.rpy:17
translate english ch3_0bacc1ca:

    # n "班级群里，「小兔」的头像亮了起来——昵称、头像都和同桌小兔一模一样。"
    n "In the class group, the avatar of \"Xiaotu\" lit up — same nickname, same profile picture as his deskmate Xiaotu."

# game/ch03.rpy:18
translate english ch3_453a1922:

    # think normal "小兔周末也上线了，正好聊聊下周的班会。"
    think normal "Xiaotu is online this weekend too. Perfect time to chat about next week's class meeting."

# game/ch03.rpy:19
translate english ch3_24c31198:

    # rabbit laugh "阿狐！可算找到你了！我遇到急事了，你一定要帮帮我！"
    rabbit laugh "Ahu! Finally found you! Something urgent came up — you HAVE to help me!"

# game/ch03.rpy:20
translate english ch3_8a5a18f1:

    # think confused "咦？小兔平时说话不是这个口气呀……可能她真的急坏了。"
    think confused "Huh? Xiaotu never talks like this... Maybe she's really panicked."

# game/ch03.rpy:23
translate english ch3_668276ab:

    # rabbit laugh "我们课外班的老师说我弄坏了教室的投影仪，让我赔800块，不然就要告诉我爸妈！"
    rabbit laugh "My tutor says I broke the classroom projector and I have to pay 800 yuan, or he'll tell my parents!"

# game/ch03.rpy:24
translate english ch3_c67b5e85:

    # rabbit laugh "我不敢跟家里人开口，你先借我800，我周一到学校就还你现金！求你了！"
    rabbit laugh "I don't dare tell my family. Lend me 800 first — I'll pay you back in cash at school on Monday! Please!"

# game/ch03.rpy:38
translate english ch3_A_83f4cd67:

    # n "阿狐盯着屏幕，越看越觉得不对劲。"
    n "Ahu stared at the screen. The more he read, the stranger it felt."

# game/ch03.rpy:39
translate english ch3_A_4c3a4cda:

    # think serious "学校反诈班会讲过「冒充同学借钱」的骗局——真同学遇到了急事，打电话一问就知道！"
    think serious "The anti-fraud class covered the \"fake classmate borrowing money\" scam — if a real classmate had an emergency, one phone call would confirm it!"

# game/ch03.rpy:40
translate english ch3_A_3d70c20e:

    # mc serious "借钱的事，网上说不好，我先打电话核实一下。"
    mc serious "Money matters can't be settled in a chat. I'll verify with a phone call first."

# game/ch03.rpy:41
translate english ch3_A_4388b875:

    # n "阿狐拨通了小兔的电话。小兔说自己的账号上周就被盗了，根本没发过赔投影仪的消息，课外班老师也从没罚过款。"
    n "Ahu called Xiaotu. She said her account was hacked last week — she never sent any message about a broken projector, and her tutor never fined anyone."

# game/ch03.rpy:42
translate english ch3_A_5e9dc7d8:

    # n "阿狐立刻把聊天记录截图发给小兔妈妈，提醒小兔赶紧找回账号。"
    n "Ahu sent screenshots of the chat to Xiaotu's mom right away and reminded Xiaotu to recover her account."

# game/ch03.rpy:45
translate english ch3_A_5dcbae03:

    # police laugh "太棒了！骗子盗取或高仿同学账号冒充本人借钱，是中小学生最容易上当的骗局之一。记住：凡是网上开口要钱的「同学」，一律先打电话、当面核实！"
    police laugh "Excellent! Scammers stealing or copying a classmate's account to borrow money in their name is one of the most common scams against students. Remember: whenever a \"classmate\" asks you for money online, verify by phone or in person first!"

# game/ch03.rpy:57
translate english ch3_B_a7cc0856:

    # n "阿狐心里犯起了嘀咕，回复追问细节。"
    n "Feeling something was off, Ahu replied and asked for details."

# game/ch03.rpy:58
translate english ch3_B_19435523:

    # mc confused "你不是好好的吗？到底出了什么事？要赔800块钱？"
    mc confused "But you were fine? What exactly happened? You have to pay 800 yuan?"

# game/ch03.rpy:59
translate english ch3_B_a1c56a83:

    # rabbit worried "我手机被老师没收了，这是借同学账号上的聊天软件，你可千万别声张！"
    rabbit worried "My phone was confiscated by the teacher. This is a classmate's account — don't tell anyone!"

# game/ch03.rpy:60
translate english ch3_B_15b36afb:

    # rabbit serious "老师催得紧，今天不赔就要告诉我爸妈。你先用你妈妈的手机扫这个码，把800转过去，我周一一定带现金还你！谢谢你，你是我最好的朋友！"
    rabbit serious "The teacher is pressing hard — if it's not paid today, he'll tell my parents. Scan this code with your mom's phone and send 800. I'll pay you back in cash on Monday, I promise! Thank you, you're my best friend!"

# game/ch03.rpy:61
translate english ch3_B_16ca84b8:

    # n "对方发来一张收款码截图，收款人却是一个陌生的名字。"
    n "The other side sent a payment QR code — but the payee's name was a total stranger."

# game/ch03.rpy:62
translate english ch3_B_5437a07e:

    # think confused "收款码上的名字，怎么既不是老师，也不是学校……"
    think confused "Why is the name on the QR code neither the teacher nor the school...?"

# game/ch03.rpy:76
translate english ch3_B1_e1cc48ce:

    # n "阿狐压住心里的着急，直接退出聊天，拿着平板走到客厅找妈妈。"
    n "Ahu held back his anxiety, left the chat, and took the tablet to the living room to find Mom."

# game/ch03.rpy:77
translate english ch3_B1_ab1a747f:

    # think worried "虽然很想帮小兔，但网上借钱总觉得不太对劲，还是先问问妈妈吧。"
    think worried "I really want to help Xiaotu, but borrowing money online feels off. I'd better ask Mom first."

# game/ch03.rpy:78
translate english ch3_B1_ff79f490:

    # mc worried "妈妈，小兔在聊天软件上找我借800块钱赔老师的东西，你看是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, Xiaotu is borrowing 800 yuan on the chat app to pay for something she broke at her tutor's. Is it real?"

# game/ch03.rpy:79
translate english ch3_B1_ad5edc24:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是典型的「盗号冒充同学」骗局哦。你看这个收款码，收款人根本不是学校，名字还是个陌生人。真同学借钱不怕打电话核实，越是让你「保密、快转」的越可疑。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the classic \"hacked account, fake classmate\" scam. Look at the QR code — the payee isn't the school at all, it's a stranger's name. A real classmate wouldn't be afraid of a verification call. The more they say \"keep it secret\" and \"hurry up\", the more suspicious it is."

# game/ch03.rpy:80
translate english ch3_B1_0d82a0dc:

    # n "妈妈帮阿狐拨打小兔的电话核实——果然，小兔的账号被盗了，学校也从没罚过款。"
    n "Mom called Xiaotu to verify — sure enough, Xiaotu's account had been hacked, and the school had never fined anyone."

# game/ch03.rpy:83
translate english ch3_B1_c4eac28b:

    # police laugh "求助家长做对了！遇到网上借钱，先停一停、问一问，和家长一起核实，骗子立刻现出原形！"
    police laugh "Asking your parents was exactly right! When someone asks for money online, pause, ask, and verify together with your parents — the scammer will be exposed at once!"

# game/ch03.rpy:95
translate english ch3_B2_14f29e9f:

    # mc serious "转钱之前，我们先开个视频，我看看你本人再说。"
    mc serious "Before any money moves, let's have a video call. I want to see you first."

# game/ch03.rpy:96
translate english ch3_B2_ff758a57:

    # rabbit worried "视频……不行不行！我手机被没收了，借来的手机摄像头是坏的，信号也不好，你别磨蹭了！"
    rabbit worried "Video? No, no! My phone was confiscated, the borrowed phone's camera is broken and the signal is bad — stop stalling!"

# game/ch03.rpy:97
translate english ch3_B2_3f990394:

    # think serious "手机被没收、摄像头坏了、还一直催……小兔从来不会这样说话。这是骗子！"
    think serious "Phone confiscated, camera broken, keeps rushing me... Xiaotu never talks like this. It's a scammer!"

# game/ch03.rpy:98
translate english ch3_B2_bd0aac2d:

    # mc serious "我不转了。你要真是小兔，明天到学校当面跟我说。"
    mc serious "I'm not sending money. If you're really Xiaotu, tell me in person at school tomorrow."

# game/ch03.rpy:99
translate english ch3_B2_1c510882:

    # n "对方立刻发来一连串催促的消息，见阿狐不再回复，头像很快变灰——账号显示已注销。"
    n "A flurry of pushy messages followed. When Ahu stopped replying, the avatar quickly went gray — the account showed as deleted."

# game/ch03.rpy:102
translate english ch3_B2_f357d386:

    # police serious "视频核实是识破冒充骗局的法宝！骗子最怕「见真人」，一要求视频就找各种借口推脱的，十有八九是骗子。"
    police serious "A video call is the perfect tool to expose impersonation scams! Scammers fear showing their real face. Anyone who makes endless excuses to avoid a video call is a scammer, nine times out of ten."

# game/ch03.rpy:114
translate english ch3_B3_4b203c15:

    # n "阿狐觉得对方连收款码都发来了，应该不会是假的，便打开妈妈的手机准备扫码。"
    n "Ahu figured that anyone who sent a real payment QR code couldn't be fake, so he opened Mom's phone to scan it."

# game/ch03.rpy:115
translate english ch3_B3_fed5b2fb:

    # n "刚扫完码，妈妈的手机就收到一条短信验证码，对方紧接着发来消息。"
    n "The moment he scanned it, Mom's phone received an SMS verification code, and a new message popped up."

# game/ch03.rpy:116
translate english ch3_B3_ee7f288d:

    # rabbit laugh "快！把刚收到的6位数字发给我，系统要验证一下，发完钱就转过去了！"
    rabbit laugh "Quick! Send me the 6-digit number you just received — the system needs to verify it, and the money will go through!"

# game/ch03.rpy:117
translate english ch3_B3_9ab9526c:

    # n "阿狐正要把数字念出来，突然想起老师的反诈课堂：验证码就是钱，谁要都不能给！"
    n "Just as Ahu was about to read out the digits, he remembered the anti-fraud lesson: a verification code is money — never give it to anyone!"

# game/ch03.rpy:118
translate english ch3_B3_cac00cf0:

    # think serious "等等！老师说过，验证码谁要都不能给！"
    think serious "Wait! Teacher said never give a verification code to anyone!"

# game/ch03.rpy:119
translate english ch3_B3_18a673a4:

    # mc serious "我不发了，你是骗子！"
    mc serious "I'm not sending it. You're a scammer!"

# game/ch03.rpy:120
translate english ch3_B3_2d82d825:

    # n "阿狐立刻停止操作，把平板拿给妈妈。妈妈当场修改支付密码、冻结付款渠道，没有造成损失。"
    n "Ahu stopped at once and handed the tablet to Mom. She changed the payment password on the spot and froze the payment channel — no loss was caused."

# game/ch03.rpy:123
translate english ch3_B3_d510911d:

    # police serious "好险！验证码和支付密码就是钱包的钥匙，任何索要验证码的「同学」「老师」「客服」都是骗子。你能及时刹住车，守住了妈妈的钱包！"
    police serious "That was close! Verification codes and payment passwords are the keys to your wallet. Any \"classmate\", \"teacher\", or \"customer service\" asking for a code is a scammer. You stopped in time and protected Mom's wallet!"

# game/ch03.rpy:135
translate english ch3_C_352fae1a:

    # n "阿狐一心想着帮好朋友，没有丝毫犹豫。"
    n "Ahu had only one thought — helping his good friend. Not a moment of hesitation."

# game/ch03.rpy:136
translate english ch3_C_f045b97e:

    # think laugh "小兔是我的好朋友，她这么着急，我一定要帮她！"
    think laugh "Xiaotu is my best friend. She's in such a panic — I have to help her!"

# game/ch03.rpy:137
translate english ch3_C_1a15ec4d:

    # mc laugh "别怕别怕，我这就帮你转，你等我！"
    mc laugh "Don't worry! I'll transfer it right now — just wait for me!"

# game/ch03.rpy:138
translate english ch3_C_a73d9a42:

    # rabbit laugh "太好了！你真是我的救命恩人！快用你妈妈的手机扫码转800，动作快点，老师马上就要告诉我爸妈了！"
    rabbit laugh "You're a lifesaver! Quick, scan the code with your mom's phone and send 800! Hurry, the teacher is about to tell my parents!"

# game/ch03.rpy:139
translate english ch3_C_e33552bc:

    # n "对方又发来一段带着哭腔的语音，一遍遍催促阿狐快点转账。"
    n "The scammer sent a teary voice message, urging Ahu over and over to transfer the money quickly."

# game/ch03.rpy:153
translate english ch3_C1_0d7b6191:

    # n "手指停在付款按钮上方，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "His finger hovered over the pay button — and suddenly Ahu's heart skipped."

# game/ch03.rpy:154
translate english ch3_C1_d3066b20:

    # think serious "不对！小兔就住我家隔壁，真出了这么大的事，她妈妈肯定直接来找我妈，怎么会只在聊天软件上找我借钱？学校反诈班会讲过——网上开口要钱的「同学」，多半是盗号的骗子！"
    think serious "Wait! Xiaotu lives right next door. If something this big happened, her mom would come straight to my mom — why would she only borrow money through the chat app? The anti-fraud class said it: a \"classmate\" asking for money online is usually a hacker behind a stolen account!"

# game/ch03.rpy:155
translate english ch3_C1_d45ed0e6:

    # mc serious "钱我不能转。你要真是小兔，就和我视频，或者我打电话给你妈妈核实。"
    mc serious "I can't send the money. If you're really Xiaotu, let's have a video call — or I'll call your mom to verify."

# game/ch03.rpy:156
translate english ch3_C1_23010095:

    # n "对面瞬间没了声音。阿狐把聊天记录拿给妈妈看，妈妈联系小兔妈妈一核实——小兔的账号被盗了，根本没有赔投影仪这回事。"
    n "The other side went silent instantly. Ahu showed the chat to Mom, who checked with Xiaotu's mother — Xiaotu's account had been hacked, and there was never any projector fine."

# game/ch03.rpy:159
translate english ch3_C1_14d0d3f7:

    # mom laugh "你能在「帮朋友」的大事面前冷静核实，做得太棒了！"
    mom laugh "You stayed calm and verified, even while trying to help a friend. Wonderful!"

# game/ch03.rpy:160
translate english ch3_C1_54b75be0:

    # police serious "临「钱」不乱，先核实再决定，这就是反诈的高手！记住：网友、同学网上借钱，一律电话、当面核实后再说。"
    police serious "Staying calm when money is involved and verifying before deciding — that's what a true anti-fraud master does! Remember: anyone asking to borrow money online gets a phone call or face-to-face check first."

# game/ch03.rpy:172
translate english ch3_C2_4fd08f85:

    # n "阿狐既怕错过帮朋友的时机，又有点不放心，决定先少转一点试试真假。"
    n "Afraid of missing the chance to help yet still uneasy, Ahu decided to send a small amount first to test the waters."

# game/ch03.rpy:173
translate english ch3_C2_ef84d93c:

    # think laugh "先转100，万一是骗子也亏得少；真是小兔，再转剩下的也不迟。"
    think laugh "Send 100 first. If it's a scammer, the loss is small; if it's really Xiaotu, I can send the rest later."

# game/ch03.rpy:174
translate english ch3_C2_9c4f1aa0:

    # n "阿狐用妈妈的手机扫码，转出了100元。"
    n "Ahu scanned the code with Mom's phone and sent 100 yuan."

# game/ch03.rpy:175
translate english ch3_C2_34dd36bb:

    # n "钱刚转过去，对方的消息就轰炸了过来。"
    n "The moment the money went through, messages started bombarding in."

# game/ch03.rpy:176
translate english ch3_C2_61db9d16:

    # rabbit serious "怎么才转100？快把剩下的700转了！不然老师马上就告诉我爸妈了！"
    rabbit serious "Why only 100? Send the remaining 700 right now, or the teacher will tell my parents!"

# game/ch03.rpy:177
translate english ch3_C2_e5ff16cc:

    # mc confused "咦？说好我垫付、周一还现金，怎么一直催着我转剩下的……"
    mc confused "Huh? We agreed I'd pay first and you'd repay me in cash on Monday. Why keep pushing for the rest...?"

# game/ch03.rpy:178
translate english ch3_C2_c74e36c2:

    # n "阿狐越想越不对，把事情告诉了妈妈。妈妈联系小兔妈妈核实——小兔账号被盗，那100元已经追不回来了。"
    n "The more Ahu thought, the wronger it felt, and he told Mom everything. Mom checked with Xiaotu's mother — the account was hacked, and the 100 yuan could not be recovered."

# game/ch03.rpy:181
translate english ch3_C2_fb0b10d6:

    # mc sad "唉，我不该抱着侥幸心理先转钱的……"
    mc sad "Sigh... I shouldn't have gambled on luck and sent money first..."

# game/ch03.rpy:182
translate english ch3_C2_720fe535:

    # police serious "骗子的套路就是一步步试探你的底线！只要转出第一笔钱，骗子就会得寸进尺。网上借钱不核实，一分钱都不能转！"
    police serious "Scammers push your limits step by step! Once the first payment goes out, they only ask for more. If it's money online without verification, don't send a single cent!"

# game/ch03.rpy:194
translate english ch3_C3_c049700c:

    # n "阿狐深信不疑，用妈妈的手机扫码，输入800元，点击付款。"
    n "Fully convinced, Ahu scanned the code with Mom's phone, entered 800 yuan, and tapped Pay."

# game/ch03.rpy:195
translate english ch3_C3_68e344f8:

    # n "转账成功。对方发来一个笑脸，紧接着又发来消息。"
    n "Transfer successful. The scammer sent a smiley face — and then another message."

# game/ch03.rpy:196
translate english ch3_C3_52249ffd:

    # rabbit laugh "太谢谢啦！老师又说还要交200元修理费，你再转200，凑够1000就彻底没事啦！"
    rabbit laugh "Thank you so much! The teacher says there's also a 200-yuan repair fee — send 200 more and it's all settled at 1,000!"

# game/ch03.rpy:197
translate english ch3_C3_c84980cc:

    # n "阿狐心里犯起嘀咕，赶紧拿着手机去客厅找妈妈。妈妈打开账单一看——800元早已被转走。"
    n "Ahu started to feel uneasy and rushed to the living room with the phone. Mom opened the bill — the 800 yuan was long gone."

# game/ch03.rpy:198
translate english ch3_C3_d8f125e4:

    # n "再点开聊天框，发出去的消息带着红色感叹号：对方已将阿狐拉黑，「小兔」的账号也显示已注销。"
    n "Back in the chat, every message showed a red exclamation mark: Ahu had been blocked, and the \"Xiaotu\" account showed as deleted."

# game/ch03.rpy:201
translate english ch3_C3_8e191afc:

    # mc sad "我……我被骗了……那是妈妈的血汗钱……"
    mc sad "I... I got scammed... That was Mom's hard-earned money..."

# game/ch03.rpy:202
translate english ch3_C3_e8ea977b:

    # n "阿狐哭着向妈妈承认了错误，妈妈抱了抱他。"
    n "Ahu admitted his mistake through tears, and Mom hugged him."

# game/ch03.rpy:203
translate english ch3_C3_7529b9b4:

    # mom normal "没关系，钱的事情以后一定要先告诉我们。记住：网上开口要钱的「同学」，先打电话核实；转账之前，永远先问爸爸妈妈。"
    mom normal "It's okay. From now on, anything involving money comes to us first. Remember: when a \"classmate\" asks for money online, verify by phone first — and before any transfer, always ask Mom and Dad."

# game/ch03.rpy:206
translate english ch3_C3_84ea77ea:

    # police serious "小朋友一定要记住！盗号冒充熟人借钱，是针对中小学生最常见的诈骗。凡是涉及转账，一定要：一核实（电话、当面）、二报告（家长老师）、三拒绝（陌生收款码）。贪一时「讲义气」，损失的可能是全家的血汗钱！"
    police serious "Kids, remember this! Hacked accounts impersonating friends to borrow money is the most common scam against students. Before any transfer: first verify (by phone, in person), second report (to parents or teachers), third refuse (strange payment codes). A moment of misplaced \"loyalty\" can cost your whole family's hard-earned savings!"

translate english strings:

    # game/ch03.rpy:27
    old "网上不谈钱，先打电话向小兔本人核实"
    new "No money talk online — call Xiaotu herself to verify first"

    # game/ch03.rpy:29
    old "觉得口气有点怪，回复追问细节"
